      "review_description": "I found the information on the Solar Quote web page to be very useful and informative, although not using one companies nominated, I was able to use the information to assess the quotes.The company I went with was obtained via personal recommendation, also they were the only ones who actually climbed onto the roof and looked at the best orientation for the panels, the other companies only used either a roof top photo or looked at  it from ground level.  There is morning shade which would have obscured the panels placed on the east of the house.",
